==Behind the scenes==
Norg Bral was first mentioned in the [[canon]] continuity in the [[2026]] reference book ''[[Star Wars: The Mandalorian Visual Guide]]'', written by [[Pablo Hidalgo]] and published by [[Dorling Kindersley]].<ref name="Mando VG" /> In[[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]], [[Norg Bral/Legends|Norg Bral]] first appeared in the adult-fiction novel series ''[[Star Wars: Legacy of the Force]]'', [[Legacy of the Force: Sacrifice|''Sacrifice'']], written by author [[Karen Traviss]] and published on [[May 29]], [[2007]].<ref name="Sacrifice">''[[Legacy of the Force: Sacrifice]]''</ref>

